                    <zone fixed-size='906' forceUpdate='true' h='4400' id='11' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='76167' x='11667' y='4000'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>[Markets]</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
                        <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='16'>How To Win Dashboard - Read Me</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4400' id='19' type-v2='text' w='11499' x='87834' y='4000'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>#pd-data-markets</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='2' h='200' id='56' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='98666' x='667' y='8400'>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin-right' value='4' />
                      <format attr='margin-left' value='4' />
                      <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='874' h='87400' id='139' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='8600'>
                    <zone fixed-size='657' forceUpdate='true' h='87400' id='140' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='55417' x='667' y='8600'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>--------------------------------------------- Active Inventory ---------------------------------------------</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Total active Inventory (at least with 1 order):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Total number of vendors with at least one order delivered in a given month. Considers only restaurants</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Sales productivity</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>activations done by Field Sales Reps( Opportunity Type Win back + New Business and exception for HK and FI that we also include &apos;Legal Form Change&apos; and &apos;Owner Change&apos;) done by Field Sales Reps (Central job role =&apos;Field Sales Representative&apos;), that are older than 2 months (account_age &gt;60) and has more than 2 activations that month (Activations&gt;2)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Sales productivity (tenured/new joiners/Tele)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Field Sales Productivity by tenure: New /Old- Depending only on account age + Field Sales Representative. New would be less than 60 days old and old more than 60 days.
Telesales Tenure Prod: It is activations done by Telesales Reps( Opportunity Type Win back + New Business and exception for HK and FI that we also include &apos;Legal Form Change&apos; and &apos;Owner Change&apos;) done by Field Sales Reps (Central_job_role in (&apos;Telesales Representative&apos;,&apos;&apos;SMB - Telesales&apos;)), that are older than 2 months (account_age &gt;60) and has more than 2 activations that month (Activations&gt;2)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>SSU Acquisitions (absolute):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'># of Inbound Vendors acquired in the month via SSU form. Note: SSU doesnt exist yet in AT &amp; FI yet</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Zombie revived:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Vendors were zombies and received at least one order in a given calendar month. Not considering incubation vendors</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Zombie formed:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Vendors that didn&apos;t receive any orders in a given calendar month. Not considering incubation vendors</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>%AB w/ both Ads &amp; Deals live on (D0/D30):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Percent of vendors with vendor grade A &amp; B with both Ads &amp; Deals live on (D0/D30)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>%AB &gt;75 orders in F60D:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Vendors with vendor grade A &amp; B with more than 75 orders in their first 60 days. Includes completed 60D in the report month</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>AMC overall adoption %</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>% of action items actioned within the month</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>--------------------------------------------- VFD/GMV ---------------------------------------------</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>VFD/GMV (food):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>VFD amount / food GMV paid by user</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>AO VFD/GMV:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>&quot;definition -&gt; (total vendor funded AO discounts + total vendor funded AO vouchers) / total resto gmv</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>AO -&gt; catch all bucket, any deal that is not pro, disco, joker, targeted deal&quot;</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Pro VFD / Pro GMV:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Numerator: Total Pro Vendor-Funded Deal Value in EUR (including vouchers, discounts, and DPS)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Denominator: GMV from Active Pro Users’ Food Orders</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Disco VFD / GMV:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Disco Vendor-Funded Deal value divided by GMV</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Deal Utilization Pro%:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>pro vendor funded orders divided by subscription orders</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Deal utilization%:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Always on vendor funded orders divided by total food orders from vendors &gt;= 1 AO VF order</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                    <zone forceUpdate='true' h='87400' id='141' type-v2='text' w='43249' x='56084' y='8600'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>--------------------------------------------- Subscription ---------------------------------------------</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Subscriber % of GMV</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Susbcribers user paid GMV / Platform user paid GMV</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Pro Vendor Weighted GMV Coverage:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Numerator: GMV from Food Vendors with &gt;= 1 Pro Vendor-Funded Pro Deal (including vouchers, discounts, and DPS)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Denominator: Total Platform Food GMV</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>--------------------------------------------- Subscription ---------------------------------------------</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>QC GMV % platform:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>QC Net GMV / Platform Net GMV</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops Commercial] # key partners per MAU (Grocery &amp; H&amp;B):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>KPI is calculated as the average number of key partners each single MAU can shop with, capping the maximum value to reach at 3 per vertical, representing a good offer. This means the maximum overall value reachable is 6. See detailed example on following link.</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops] Vendor Fail Rate:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>(Shops) Vendor Fail Rate = Failed orders due to vendor / Gross orders</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops Ops] % items not delivered:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>TBD.</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Dmarts SC] Dmart weighted availability v2:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>(Dmart) WA % = Overall Availability of SKUs weighted by sales forecast and sessions (central&apos;s calculation)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops] Offline Rate (Weighted):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Offline rate:Total offline minutes / Total scheduled open minutes, with higher weightage applied to Vendors with greater contribution of Orders</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops Commercial] Grocery Assortment Quality Score (AAA supermarkets):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Assortment Quality Score: Composite metrics of assortment size, assortment design, ultra fresh performance, buyable rate, category breath, and fresh performance. See detailed explanation here</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Dmart Commercial] Dmart Assortment quality score v6:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Assortment: Average active SKU number per AAA supermarket</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Dmart] Fresh and Ultra Fresh Basket Penetration:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Penetration: % of orders containing at least one Fresh or Ultra Fresh product</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>[Shops Commercial] Promo GPV % (Grocery &amp; H&amp;B key partners):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>% of GPV (GFV) of promotional items over Total GPV - only applicable to AAA partners</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>QC New to Vertical (QC Trials):</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'># of customers placing their first LS or Dmart order on the platform</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      </zone-style>
                    </zone>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
